b81.description:
When dealing Physical damage to the target, if its defense has been reduced by <c2>more than 100%</c>, for every additional <c2>1%</c> reduction of defense, damage dealt to the target is increased by an equivalent amount. Considered a buff, cannot be cleansed. The ratios are as follows:
Additional defense reduction percentage <c2><100%</c>: <c2>0.5%</c>;
<c2>100%≤</c> Additional defense reduction percentage <c2><200%</c>: <c2>0.75%</c>;
<c2>200%≤</c> Additional defense reduction percentage <c2><300%</c>: <c2>1%</c>;
Additional defense reduction percentage <c2>≥300%</c>: <c2>1.5%</c>.
